- The concentration fields are model output derived from EEA, Copernicus (CAMS, ERA5), EDGAR and GHSL data;
  see docs/sources.html for each provider's licence and required attribution.
- The viewer loads MapLibre GL JS (BSD-3-Clause), OpenFreeMap tiles (© OpenMapTiles, © OpenStreetMap contributors)
  and Terrain Tiles on AWS (Mapzen) at run time.
